# Context of deploy/docker/web.Dockerfile (spec 3.2). BuildKit reads this file instead of the root
# .dockerignore, which belongs to the Go image and excludes the web workspaces.
.git
.worktrees
.codegraph
.claude
**/node_modules
**/.next
secrets
internal
cmd
migrations
shared
docs
deploy
**/e2e
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
# A .env file would be copied by `COPY . .` and then by Next into .next/standalone (writeStandaloneDirectory), so its
# values would sit in a layer of the runtime image. The files are gitignored, so no review would ever see them (merge-r1-6).
**/.env
**/.env.*
